cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, its result files or its weights, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SonoSpadePP: patient-faithful, real-time ultrasound synthesis from CT for teaching simulators"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/tohnperfect/SonoSpadePP"
# doi: fill in after the first release is archived (Zenodo)
abstract: >-
  Code, result files and table scripts for a study of CT-to-ultrasound translation in teaching
  simulators: SonoSPADE trained at three levels of supervision (unpaired frames, registered CT and
  ultrasound planes of other patients, one image of the patient), evaluated per tissue, in the
  speckle, and against real ultrasound of the same patient.
keywords:
  - ultrasound simulation
  - image synthesis
  - computed tomography
  - speckle
  - medical education
